625-textlint-12/","original_url":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210625-textlint-12/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5n+m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99a8d195-270f-44c2-a01f-a7913a089a9f","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"私も採血の時に迷走神経反射になりやすいです。\nでも注射の時は平気ですね。","ts":"1624611833.467300","edited":{"user":"UP6PA1UBE","ts":"1624611844.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aZ5VM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b2b7a3f-718a-45c9-9669-5c5097db4ba4","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"とりあえず、打つ腕聞かれたときは利き腕じゃないほう選びましょうね!","ts":"1624607717.465700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["U81LLJ340","U022TD5GGKE","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v9ev"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a51cb1b-2777-4c42-a61e-03296bf2edb3","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"歳取った後の筋肉痛と同じく翌日がしんどいらしいので無理はしないようにしてください…。","ts":"1624607635.464600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i2KU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d189955e-cf1d-4332-b0c4-2cb56f504426","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"そういや今日打ってきましたが、今のところ利き腕が重くて上がらないくらいで済んでます","ts":"1624607508.463000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":6,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U7JL1UKKL","UL6CFN8NR","U01BY3SDBRS","UEACRCY0Z","UFP0GQZ4K"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FRv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a41967f-0336-4d89-929d-07f3d93ff3e3","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ワクチン接種のためと接種当日と翌日で有休取っておきましたが、迷走神経反射になりやすい体質なもんで少し心配ではある…。","ts":"1624607430.462200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EpeH9"}]},{"type":"message","us